      {
       "w": 100,
       "small": false,
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p>The following is a list of common eye conditions. For information about cataracts, glaucoma, macular degeneration and diabetic retinopathy please see <a href=\"/your-eye-health/eye-diseases/\">Eye Diseases</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
         "t": "childpages",
         "items": [
          {
           "title": "Glaucoma",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/glaucoma/",
           "summary": "Glaucoma is a leading cause of preventable vision loss and blindness in adults in the United States and Canada and the second leading cause of blindness in the World.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Amblyopia (Lazy Eye)",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/amblyopia-lazy-eye/",
           "summary": "Commonly called \"lazy eye\", amblyopia can be treated successfully if detected early enough in childhood.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Astigmatism",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/astigmatism/",
           "summary": "Often mistakenly called “stigmatism,” this common vision problem can be corrected with eyeglasses, contact lenses or refractive surgery.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Blepharitis",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/blepharitis/",
           "summary": "Red, swollen eyelids and crusty debris at the base of your eyelashes are signs you may have blepharitis.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "CMV Retinitis",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/cmv-retinitis/",
           "summary": "AIDS or other diseases that affect your immune system can increase your risk of serious eye problems from cytomegalovirus (CMV) infection.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Corneal Transplant",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/corneal-transplant/",
           "summary": "People with serious vision problems from an eye injury or disease affecting the front surface of the eye can often regain vision with a cornea transplant.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Dry Eye Syndrome",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/dry-eye-syndrome/",
           "summary": "Dry eye syndrome is a common condition, especially in women over age 40. Many treatment options are available.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Eye Allergies",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/eye-allergies/",
           "summary": "Are you bothered by red, itchy eyes? You may have allergies.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Eye Floaters and Spots",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/eye-floaters-and-spots/",
           "summary": "“Floaters” are usually normal and harmless. But if you notice a sudden increase in floaters or floaters accompanied by flashes of light, see your eye doctor immediately.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Farsighted (Hyperopia)",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/farsighted-hyperopia/",
           "summary": "Also called farsightedness, hyperopia is a common vision problem that can cause headaches, eyestrain and trouble reading.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Keratoconus",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/keratoconus/",
           "summary": "This eye disease causes the cornea to grow thinner and bulge forward in an irregular cone-shape. Treatment options range from gas permeable contact lenses to a cornea transplant.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Nearsighted (Myopia)",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/nearsighted-myopia/",
           "summary": "Also called nearsightedness, myopia is a very common vision problem, affecting up to one-third of the U.S. population.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Ocular Hypertension",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/ocular-hypertension/",
           "summary": "You’ve heard of high blood pressure, but what about high eye pressure?",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Photophobia",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/photophobia/",
           "summary": "",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Pingueculae & Pterygia",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/pingueculae-pterygia/",
           "summary": "",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Pink Eye (Conjunctivitis)",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/pink-eye-conjunctivitis/",
           "summary": "This acute and contagious form of conjunctivitis is particularly common among preschoolers and school-age children.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Presbyopia",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/presbyopia/",
           "summary": "",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Ptosis",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/ptosis/",
           "summary": "",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Retinal Detachment",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/retinal-detachment/",
           "summary": "",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Retinitis Pigmentosa",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/retinitis-pigmentosa/",
           "summary": "These inherited disorders, commonly abbreviated as RP, cause progressive peripheral vision loss, night blindness and central vision loss.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Styes",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/styes/",
           "summary": "This common problem is simply an infected lid gland. Learn how to prevent and treat styes.",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          },
          {
           "title": "Uveitis",
           "href": "/eye-care-services/your-eye-health/eye-conditions-info/uveitis/",
           "summary": "",
           "image": null,
           "imageAlt": ""
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
